{
  "name": "Dragonseye Oak Acorn",
  "type": "consumable",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Usage</strong> material component of a spell</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span> interact; <strong>Trigger</strong> You cast a spell from the school of Evocation with the acid, cold, electricity, fire, or sonic trait</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When used as a material component (adding the material component to the spell if it doesn't already have it) for an evocation spell with the acid, cold, electricity, fire, or sonic trait you gain a circumstance bonus to damage equal to twice the level of the spell as well as 1d4 @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.lDVqvLKA6eF3Df60]{Persistent Damage} of the same type on a critical hit. </p>"
    },
